It then opens two files, `questions.txt` and `answers.txt`, for writing using the `File` and `PrintWriter` classes. It writes the expression and answer to the respective files using the `println` method of the `PrintWriter` class. Finally, it closes the files using the `close` method of the `PrintWriter` class.

As before, if you want to generate expressions with decimal coefficients, you can use the `nextDouble` method of the `Random` class to generate random decimal values for `a` and `b`.

